      <h1>Canada Life Coverage for Wellness Care <em>Paramedical Benefits, Claims and Spending Accounts</em></h1>
      <p>This guide explains how Canada Life group benefits usually treat the wellness care listed on WellFinder, including physiotherapy, chiropractic care and massage therapy. It covers claiming through My Canada Life at Work, direct submission by providers, and the health care spending account many Canada Life plans include.</p>
      <p>The details that decide any claim sit in your own plan, which your employer chose. Sign in to your account to read your coverage and balances before you book, and use this guide to know what to look for.</p>
      <p class="byline">By WellFinder · November 2026 · 5 min read</p>
    </div>
      </div>

  </section>

